   <div  class="desc-text-container mobile d-md-none d-block" id="intro-mobile">
     <div class="content w-100">
                <div class="container text-center custom-container">
                  
                    <p class="m-0" style="font-size: 13px;">At the helm of SOBHA’s diversified portfolio stands a visionary team of leaders, whose strategic foresight and disciplined execution propel the brand forward. <br>Their unwavering commitment to quality, precision, and long-term value continues to shape its evolution while upholding its legacy of perfection.  </p>
                </div>
            </div>
</div>
   <div  id="tab-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wow fadeIn" data-wow-duration="0.7s" data-wow-delay="0.1s">
        <div class="container custom-container">
