            <div class="tab-content"> 
                                <div id="formermessage" class="first-tabcontent d-block tab-information mb-md-5 mb-4">
                    <!-- <div class="d-none d-md-block"> -->
                        <div class="row mb-4 justify-content-between">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 order-md-1 order-2">
                                                                <h3 class="mb-4 d-none d-md-block">ABOUT OUR FOUNDER</h3>
                                                                <div class="content">
                                    <div class="mb-4 pr-md-5"><p>Enduring enterprises are built on conviction, resilience, and a relentless pursuit of perfection. The extraordinary journey of Mr. PNC Menon reflects these very ideals.</p>
<p>Born in Kerala, Mr. Menon stepped into the role of a family leader at a tender age. With limited formal education but indomitable determination, he ventured to Oman to establish an interior decoration business that changed his course of life.</p>
<p>With an innate eye for detail and a steadfast commitment to craftsmanship, he soon garnered recognition, earning prestigious assignments such as the Sultan Qaboos Grand Mosque and Al Bustan Palace in Muscat.</p>
<p>What began as a modest entrepreneurial pursuit evolved into a global luxury real estate powerhouse — SOBHA. Founded in 1995, the company expanded steadily across geographies, establishing itself as an epitome of quality and self-reliance.</p>
<p>Mr. Menon adopted a visionary model centred around in-house expertise and quality control, distinguishing SOBHA in a fragmented industry. Its ventures span real estate development, contracting, and allied construction services.</p>
<p>A man of profound values, Mr. PNC Menon has devoted decades to philanthropy, pledging half of his wealth through The Giving Pledge and advancing education, healthcare, and social development via the <span style="white-space: nowrap;"> Sri Kurumba Trust </span> and initiatives like the Sabarmati Riverfront. His contributions to both industry and society have been honoured with numerous accolades, notably the Pravasi Bharatiya Samman and the Golden Peacock Lifetime Achievement Award, cementing his legacy as a true visionary and humanitarian.</p>
</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="button-wrapper text-center">
                                    <a href="javascript:" class="read-more-2">Read More</a>
                                </div>
                                                            <h5 class="mt-md-5 mt-4 d-none d-md-block"> MR. PNC MENON | CHAIRMAN EMERITUS</h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 px-md-5 mb-4 order-md-2 order-1">
                                                                <img fetchpriority="high" src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Leadership-Mr.-PNC-Menon-Founder-and-Chairman-Emeritus-SOBHA.jpg" class="img-fluid w-100" alt="Leadership - Mr. PNC Menon - Founder and Chairman Emeritus - SOBHA" title="Leadership - Mr. PNC Menon - Founder and Chairman Emeritus - SOBHA">
                                <h5 class="mt-md-5 mt-4 d-md-none"> MR. PNC MENON | CHAIRMAN EMERITUS</h5>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    <!-- </div> -->
                    <!-- <div class="d-md-none">
                        <div class="row mb-md-4 justify-content-between">
                            <div class="col-md-6 px-md-5 mb-4">
                                <h3 class="mb-4 d-none d-md-block"></h3>
                                <img src="" class="img-fluid w-100" alt="">
                                <h5 class="mt-md-5 mt-4">  | </h5>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-md-4">
                                                                <div class="content">
                                <div class="mb-md-4 pr-md-5"><p>Mr. Ravi PNC Menon is the architect of SOBHA’s remarkable transformation in Indian real estate. Since joining SOBHA in 2004, he has steered the company’s evolution from a Bengaluru-focused developer to a revered national brand, now present in over 10 major cities across India.</p>
<p>Under his astute leadership, SOBHA has emerged as a beacon of self-reliance, pioneering the Backward Integration model that brought construction, interiors, and quality management entirely in-house. SOBHA became the first real estate company in India to embrace this innovative approach, allowing for unparalleled control over every facet, from design to delivery. This strategy has redefined operational excellence, setting the gold standard in Indian real estate.</p>
<p>He has spearheaded iconic projects such as the SOBHA Dream Series, envisioned for young professionals, and the adoption of precast construction technology to accelerate project timelines. He also founded the SOBHA Design Studio, bringing together the finest global talent to create architectural masterpieces that transcend time and trend.</p>
<p>A proponent of autonomy, accountability, and innovation, Mr. Menon has cultivated a culture of ownership and excellence within SOBHA. He has earned prestigious accolades, including<span data-contrast="auto">  </span><span data-contrast="auto">Best CEO of the Year (2016) by Construction Times and Impactful CSR Leader of India (2025) by ET Edge.</span></p>
<p>Mr. Menon’s influence extends SOBHA’s impact far beyond the business realm. He has dedicated himself to philanthropy, advancing education, community development, and social initiatives, ensuring that SOBHA’s legacy of perfection leaves an indelible mark on both the industry and society.</p>
</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
