                </div> 
                            <div id="message" class="first-tabcontent d-block tab-information mb-md-5 mb-4">
                    <!-- <div class="d-none d-md-block"> -->
                        <div class="row mb-4 justify-content-between">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 order-md-1 order-2">
                                                                <h3 class="mb-4 d-none d-md-block">MEET OUR CHAIRMAN</h3>
                                <div class="content">
                                    <div class="mb-4 pr-md-5"><p>Mr. Ravi PNC Menon is the architect of SOBHA’s remarkable transformation in Indian real estate. Since joining SOBHA in 2004, he has steered the company’s evolution from a Bengaluru-focused developer to a revered national brand, now present in over 10 major cities across India.</p>
<p>Under his astute leadership, SOBHA has emerged as a beacon of self-reliance, pioneering the Backward Integration model that brought construction, interiors, and quality management entirely in-house. SOBHA became the first real estate company in India to embrace this innovative approach, allowing for unparalleled control over every facet, from design to delivery. This strategy has redefined operational excellence, setting the gold standard in Indian real estate.</p>
<p>He has spearheaded iconic projects such as the SOBHA Dream Series, envisioned for young professionals, and the adoption of precast construction technology to accelerate project timelines. He also founded the SOBHA Design Studio, bringing together the finest global talent to create architectural masterpieces that transcend time and trend.</p>
<p>A proponent of autonomy, accountability, and innovation, Mr. Menon has cultivated a culture of ownership and excellence within SOBHA. He has earned prestigious accolades, including<span data-contrast="auto">  </span><span data-contrast="auto">Best CEO of the Year (2016) by Construction Times and Impactful CSR Leader of India (2025) by ET Edge.</span></p>
<p>Mr. Menon’s influence extends SOBHA’s impact far beyond the business realm. He has dedicated himself to philanthropy, advancing education, community development, and social initiatives, ensuring that SOBHA’s legacy of perfection leaves an indelible mark on both the industry and society.</p>
</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="button-wrapper text-center">
                                    <a href="javascript:" class="read-more">Read More</a>
                                </div>
                                <h5 class="mt-md-5 mt-4 d-none d-md-block"> MR. RAVI MENON | CHAIRMAN</h5>
                            </div>
