                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">DEVARAJA T.H</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">HEAD - ELECTRICAL & HVAC</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Devaraja heads the Electrical and HVAC function at SOBHA Limited.</p>
<p class="mb-2">He has more than 28 years of experience in the field of design and execution of electrical systems in one pf the most reputed software company campuses, hi-rise apartments, villas, 5-star hotels and office complexes. He is an excellent trainer and member of ‘The Institution of Engineers’. Before joining Sobha, he has worked as a lecturer and Class1 contractor.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His hobbies include reading Books, playing Cricket and social service.</p>
</div>
