                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">HARISH BABU</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">CEO - INTERIORS DIVISION</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Harish heads the Interior division of SOBHA Limited.</p>
<p class="mb-2">With over 29 YEARS of experience he has developed expertise in the field of interiors, designs, and production. He has worked in middle east for 10 years on various prestigious projects of international scale, adding to his expert knowledge in the field of interior design. Instrumental in adoption of new age technologies in the organization, Harish has enabled the company to provide superior quality products to customers.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His hobbies include Chess, movies, music.</p>
</div>
