                                                        <img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid" alt="PRASANNA VENKATESH" title="PRASANNA VENKATESH" data-lazy-src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Web-1920-–-25.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Web-1920-–-25.png" class="img-fluid" alt="PRASANNA VENKATESH" title="PRASANNA VENKATESH"></noscript>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">PRASANNA VENKATESH</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">HEAD - PLUMBING, ENVIRONMENT & FIRE</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Prasanna heads the Plumbing, Fire and Environmental services function at SOBHA Limited.</p>
<p class="mb-2">With more than 28 year experience, he has been instrumental in managing design and execution of Plumbing, Fire and Environmental services at some of the most reputed Software campuses, Hi-rise Apartments, Villas, 5-star Hotels and office complexes. Before joining SOBHA, he was associated with M/s Adarsh Developers and M/s Precise Engineers.</p>
<p class="mb-2">He is a Certified water auditor and Green Plumbing India Accredited Professional too.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His passion includes wildlife photography for which he has received national and international awards.</p>
</div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                       
                                </div>  
                                                                <div class="col-md-3 col-6 mb-md-5 mb-4 pb-1 pb-md-0">
                                    <a class="modal-click d-block" href="javascript:">
                                            
                                        <div class="img-wrapper mb-4">
                                            <img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid" alt="" title="rajesh" data-lazy-src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/rajesh.jpg"><noscript><img src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/rajesh.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="" title="rajesh"></noscript>
                                        </div>
                                                                                                                        <h6 class="mb-2">RAJESH NAIR</h6>
                                                                                                                        <p class="text-center" style="color: #999999; font-size: 13px;">CEO- GLAZING & METAL WORKS DIVISION</p>
                                                                            </a> 
                                                                        <div class="modal-wrapper">
                                        <div class="modal-content">
                                            <a href="javascript:" class="close-popup">
