                                            </a>
                                            <div class="inner-content">
                                                <div class="inner-text">
                                                    <div class="img-wrap mb-3">
                                                        <img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid" alt="" title="rajesh" data-lazy-src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/rajesh.jpg"><noscript><img src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/rajesh.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt="" title="rajesh"></noscript>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">RAJESH NAIR</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">CEO- GLAZING & METAL WORKS DIVISION</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Rajesh Nair has been heading our Glazing &amp; Metal Works Division since May 2025, bringing over three decades of extensive experience in the construction industry.</p>
<p class="mb-2">He began his career with us in the Project execution and has steadily advanced through a series of pivotal roles within the organization for the last 24 years.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His consistent performance, strong leadership, and deep alignment with our core values have played a vital role in the success of various departments, including the Project Execution Team both real estate &amp; contracts and the Interiors Division. Before taking over as Head of Glazing &amp; metal works division, he was working as Chief Procurement Officer in our Corporate office.</p>
<p class="mb-2">Outside of his professional commitments, Rajesh is an avid badminton player and a keen reader, pursuits that keep him energized and inspired.</p>
</div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                       
                                </div>  
