                                            <img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%200%200'%3E%3C/svg%3E" class="img-fluid" alt="RAGHU BALAN" title="RAGHU BALAN" data-lazy-src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raghu1.png"><noscript><img src="https://www.sobha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raghu1.png" class="img-fluid" alt="RAGHU BALAN" title="RAGHU BALAN"></noscript>
                                        </div>
                                                                                                                        <h6 class="mb-2">RAGHU BALAN</h6>
                                                                                                                        <p class="text-center" style="color: #999999; font-size: 13px;">CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER</p>
