                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">RAGHU BALAN</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p>Raghu Balan currently  heads the Quality, Safety &amp;Technology(QST); Infrastructure; Value Engineering; Vendor Development and R&amp;D Departments for Real Estate vertical and Leadership Development and Training Department for the Organization. He has been in this role for last 11+ years.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Prior to this, he was handling the projects both in Real Estate and Contractual vertical of Sobha for a span of more than 15 years.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Before joining Sobha he has worked as Asst. Manager, Hindustan Construction Company Limited, Mumbai and as Planning Engineer, Services &amp; Trade Company, Muscat, Sultanate of Oman.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>He loves sports, swimming, travelling and watching period movies during leisure time.</p>
</div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                       
                                </div>  
