                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">SATISH KAMATH</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">HEAD - HUMAN RESOURCES</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Satish heads the human resource function at SOBHA Limited. He has been instrumental in conceptualizing and implementing HR strategies, policies &amp; programs from scratch and delivered efficient &amp; effective HR services and support to the business.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His past experience includes some of the most reputed organisations like Reliance, Godrej &amp; Videocon, where he has handled challenging assignments in Change Management, Organisational development and Industrial Relations.</p>
<p class="mb-2">He loves reading fiction books, cooking, travelling and cricket.</p>
</div>
                                                </div>
