                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">SUMEET CHUNKHARE</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">CHIEF MARKETING & COMMUNICATIONS OFFICER</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Sumeet heads the Marketing,  Public Relations, Corporate Communications and Pre-Sales functions at SOBHA Limited.</p>
<p class="mb-2">With over 15 years of experience across FMCG, Fin Tech and Real Estate industries, he has worked with reputed companies like ITC Ltd., Bayer (Monsanto Holdings) and Lodha Group before joining SOBHA in November 2019.</p>
<p class="mb-2">He holds an MBA in Marketing &amp; Finance from Indian Institute of Management, Lucknow and a Bachelor of Commerce from R.A. Podar College, University of Mumbai.</p>
<p class="mb-2">His passion includes travel, sports and current affairs.</p>
</div>
                                                </div>
