                                                    </div>
                                                    <h3 class="mb-2">YOGESH BANSAL</h3>
                                                    <h5 class="mb-4">CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER</h5>
                                                    <div class="mb-3"><p class="mb-2">Yogesh Bansal has about 20 years&#8217; experience in finance, compliance, process control, risk management and accounting. He has been with SOBHA since April 2011, and was closely associated with the company&#8217;s business in the NCR and GIFT City regions, where he oversaw the financial operations. He holds a Bachelor’s degree in Commerce and is member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI).</p>
<p class="mb-2">Prior to joining SOBHA, Yogesh worked with a real estate company and consulting firm.</p>
</div>
